Platform: iOS, iPadOS
Langages: swift
Workflow:
    1:APP will boot up GAME MODE
    2:GAME MODE means that generate and record the bingo numbers
    3:On GAME MODE, the APP shows the latest number prominently at the screen
    4:Otherwise, with previously published numbers listed below in descending order.
    5:In progress of bing, User can switch CHECK MODE as their demand.
    6:On CHECK MODE, User should prepare paper bingo sheets which is puched with hitted numbers
    6:Users take those photos with iOS devives to tap <写真でチェック> button on screen.
    7:When several photos are feeded to APP, The numbers detected from the photo are cross-checked with the previously announced numbers.
    8:The result is displayed on the screen as either 'MATCHED' or 'UNMATCHED'
    9:When the result is appeared, User can choice which continue to CHECK MODE or return to GAME MODE
Screen size:iPad Air 13 inch Landscape and Portrait
